<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended March 15 totalled 140.027 million, versus a revised 138.776 million in the previous week and 136.164 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 172.317 million, versus a revised 172.841 million the previous week and 164.608 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
